---
import data from '../site-data.json';
import catalog from '../catalog.json';
import '../style.css';
const count=new Map();for(const p of data.posts)count.set(p.topic,(count.get(p.topic)||0)+1);
const groups=[...count].sort((a,b)=>b[1]-a[1]).map(([name,n])=>({name,n,posts:data.posts.filter(p=>p.topic===name).sort((a,b)=>a.date.localeCompare(b.date)||a.index-b.index)}));
const modes=[['timeline','Timeline'],['topics','Topics'],['response','Response map'],['words','Writing & response'],['rank','Ranking'],['palette','Colour'],['format','Format']];
const safeJSON=JSON.stringify({...data,sprite:{cols:data.sprite.cols,rows:data.sprite.rows}}).replaceAll('<','\\u003c');
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><meta name="theme-color" content="#10253f"/><meta name="description" content="Riad Meddeb’s LinkedIn presence: explore 277 recovered posts through their images, topics and public response."/><title>Riad Meddeb · LinkedIn presence</title><link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 32 32'%3E%3Crect width='32' height='32' rx='8' fill='%2300689d'/%3E%3Ctext x='16' y='23' text-anchor='middle' fill='white' font-size='22'%3ER%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E"/></head><body>
<a class="skip" href="#atlas">Skip to post atlas</a><header><a class="brand" href="#">RIAD MEDDEB <span>/ LINKEDIN</span></a><nav><a href="#atlas">Post atlas</a><a href="#report">Analysis</a><a href="#method">Method</a></nav></header><main>
<section class="hero"><div class="eyebrow">March 2023 — September 2026</div><h1>Riad Meddeb’s<br/><em>LinkedIn presence</em></h1><p>The topics he covers, how his writing has changed, and which posts attract reactions and comments.</p><div class="hero-bottom"><div><strong>277</strong> recovered posts <span>·</span> <strong>276</strong> main visuals</div><a href="Riad_Meddeb_LinkedIn_Visual_Analysis.docx">Read the report ↗</a></div></section>
<section id="atlas" class="atlas-section"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">01 / Explore the posts</span><h2>Explore the post archive</h2></div><p>Every image is a post.<br/>Change the view to follow a different question.</p></div>
<div class="post-atlas" id="post-atlas"><div class="atlas-controls" id="atlas-controls"><div class="view-tabs" role="group" aria-label="Atlas layout">{modes.map(([id,title])=><button data-mode={id} aria-pressed={id==='topics'}>{title}</button>)}</div><div class="filters"><label class="search">Search posts<input id="search" type="search" placeholder="Search full captions…"/></label><div class="year-filter"><span>Year</span><div role="group" aria-label="Year">{['all','2023','2024','2025','2026'].map(year=><button data-year={year} aria-pressed={year==='all'}>{year==='all'?'All':year}</button>)}</div></div><label>Topic<select id="topic" aria-label="Topic"><option value="all">All topics</option>{Object.keys(data.colors).map(topic=><option>{topic}</option>)}</select></label><label id="rank-control" hidden>Rank by<select id="metric" aria-label="Rank by"><option value="reactions">Reactions</option><option value="comments">Comments</option></select></label><button id="reset" hidden>Clear filters</button></div></div>
<div class="atlas-caption"><p id="view-description">See the visual balance across named topics.</p><span id="atlas-count" role="status">277 of 277 posts</span></div>
<div class="atlas-window" tabindex="0" aria-label="Scrollable post visualization"><div id="atlas-stage" class="atlas-stage static-atlas" style={`--atlas-image:url("${data.sprite.src}");--atlas-size:1600% 1800%`}>
{groups.map(group=><><h3 class="static-group">{group.name}<small>{group.n} posts</small></h3>{group.posts.map(p=><button class="post-icon" data-id={p.id} aria-label={`Post ${p.index}, ${p.date}: ${p.title}. ${p.reactions??'Unknown'} reactions, ${p.comments??'Unknown'} comments`} style={`--topic:${data.colors[p.topic]||'#748b99'}`}>
{p.image?<span class="post-thumb" aria-hidden="true" data-post-id={p.id} style={`background-position:${p.sprite[0]/15*100}% ${p.sprite[1]/17*100}%`}></span>:<span class="no-image">Text<br/>only</span>}<span class="post-index">{p.index}</span></button>)}</>)}
</div></div>
<div class="atlas-inspector" aria-live="polite"><span id="inspector-index" class="inspector-index"></span><div><strong id="inspector-title">Select an image to read its caption and inspect its counters.</strong><small id="inspector-meta">Image proportions are preserved.</small></div><button id="inspect-post" hidden>Read post ↗</button></div>
<details id="missing" class="missing" hidden><summary></summary><div></div></details>
<details id="text-index" class="text-index"><summary>Browse this selection as an accessible text list (277)</summary><div></div></details></div></section>
<section id="report"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">02 / Read the analysis</span><h2>Patterns behind the posts</h2></div><p>Topic comparisons, writing patterns and public response, with the source posts one click away.</p></div><div class="analysis-nav"><label>Go to analysis<select id="analysis-jump"><option value="">Choose a chart</option>{catalog.map(f=><option value={f.id}>{f.title}</option>)}</select></label><span>{catalog.length} analyses</span></div>
{catalog.map(f=><article class="figure" id={f.id}><div class="figureheader"><span class="eyebrow">{f.chapter} / {String(f.number).padStart(2,'0')}</span><h2>{f.title}</h2></div><div class="figuretext"><p>{f.analysis}</p></div><div class="chart-placeholder" aria-label="Chart loads when visible"></div><details class="figure-note"><summary>Sample and interpretation</summary><p>{f.note}</p><a href={`d3_figures/${f.id}.svg`}>Original report figure ↗</a></details></article>)}
</section>
<section id="method" class="method"><span class="eyebrow">03 / Sources & files</span><h2>What the record can tell us</h2><p>The expanded archive contains 277 recovered records. Original caption comparisons use 235 eligible English captions; response rankings use 246 original activities with both counters, excluding reposts. The atlas shows the expanded record and uses known counters for its response views.</p><p>Baseline counters were collected on 1 October 2026 UTC and browser checks made on 2 October. They are cumulative public counts, not reach or engagement rates. Missing counters are unknown. The 2023 sample is incomplete; recovered counts do not establish annual posting totals. Full-account completeness remains unverified. Twenty additions lack resolved activity IDs and all 21 additions lack independently resolved exact UTC times.</p><p>Colour families describe image pixels, not semantic meaning. The saved visual may be a document or video cover. One post has no standalone visual. Images retain their original aspect ratios.</p><div class="downloads"><a href="Riad_Meddeb_Expanded_Dataset.xlsx">Spreadsheet ↗</a><a href="Riad_Meddeb_Expanded_Dataset.csv">Post data · CSV ↗</a><a href="Riad_Meddeb_LinkedIn_Visual_Analysis.docx">Word report ↗</a><a href="Image_Manifest.csv">Image manifest ↗</a><a href="Figure_Source_Manifest.csv">Figure sources ↗</a></div></section><footer>Prepared from the supplied package and signed-in browser audit.</footer></main>
<dialog id="post-dialog" aria-labelledby="post-title"><button class="close">Close ×</button><div class="dialoggrid"><div id="dialog-image"></div><div><span id="post-meta" class="eyebrow"></span><h2 id="post-title"></h2><p id="post-topic"></p><div id="post-counters" class="counters"></div><p id="post-caption" class="caption"></p><p id="post-check" class="counter-note"></p><div id="post-links" class="downloads"></div></div></div></dialog>
<noscript><p>The atlas images and analysis text are available without JavaScript. Enable JavaScript for filters and post dialogs, or download the spreadsheet for full captions.</p></noscript>
<script id="atlas-data" type="application/json" is:inline set:html={safeJSON}></script><script>import '../app.js';</script>
</body></html>
